{"status": 200, "url_final": "https://sametkabay.github.io/agent-arena/", "html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n  <head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" />\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, viewport-fit=cover\" />\n    <title>Agent Arena \u2014 3D multi-agent playground in the browser</title>\n    <meta\n      name=\"description\"\n      content=\"Agent Arena is an open-source, browser-native multi-agent playground. Place LLM characters on a 3D map, watch them live, and chat \u2014 no backend.\"\n    />\n    <meta name=\"author\" content=\"Samet Kabay\" />\n    <meta name=\"application-name\" content=\"Agent Arena\" />\n    <meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#7a9e7e\" />\n    <meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-image-preview:large\" />\n    <link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://sametkabay.github.io/agent-arena/\" />\n    <link\n      rel=\"alternate\"\n      type=\"text/plain\"\n      title=\"llms.txt\"\n      href=\"https://sametkabay.github.io/agent-arena/llms.txt\"\n    />\n    <link rel=\"license\" href=\"https://github.com/sametkabay/agent-arena/blob/main/LICENSE\" />\n    <meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Agent Arena\" />\n    <meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" />\n    <meta\n      property=\"og:title\"\n      content=\"Agent Arena \u2014 3D multi-agent playground in the browser\"\n    />\n    <meta\n      property=\"og:description\"\n      content=\"Agent Arena is an open-source, browser-native multi-agent playground. Place LLM characters on a 3D map, watch them live, and chat \u2014 no backend.\"\n    />\n    <meta\n      property=\"og:image\"\n      content=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/sametkabay/agent-arena/main/docs/screenshot-space-night.png\"\n    />\n    <meta property=\"og:image:type\" content=\"image/png\" />\n    <meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1600\" />\n    <meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"900\" />\n    <meta\n      property=\"og:image:alt\"\n      content=\"Space map at night \u2014 four agents on a planetary outpost, private chat open\"\n    />\n    <meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://sametkabay.github.io/agent-arena/\" />\n    <meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\" />\n    <meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" />\n    <meta\n      name=\"twitter:title\"\n      content=\"Agent Arena \u2014 3D multi-agent playground in the browser\"\n    />\n    <meta\n      name=\"twitter:description\"\n      content=\"Agent Arena is an open-source, browser-native multi-agent playground. Place LLM characters on a 3D map, watch them live, and chat \u2014 no backend.\"\n    />\n    <meta\n      name=\"twitter:image\"\n      content=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/sametkabay/agent-arena/main/docs/screenshot-space-night.png\"\n    />\n    <meta\n      name=\"twitter:image:alt\"\n      content=\"Space map at night \u2014 four agents on a planetary outpost, private chat open\"\n    />\n    <link rel=\"icon\" type=\"image/svg+xml\" href=\"/agent-arena/favicon.svg\" />\n    <link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" href=\"/agent-arena/apple-touch-icon.png\" />\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\" />\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin />\n    <link\n      href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Nunito:wght@500;700;800&display=swap\"\n      rel=\"stylesheet\"\n    />\n    <script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n      {\n        \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n        \"@graph\": [\n          {\n            \"@type\": \"WebSite\",\n            \"@id\": \"https://sametkabay.github.io/agent-arena/#website\",\n            \"name\": \"Agent Arena\",\n            \"url\": \"https://sametkabay.github.io/agent-arena/\",\n            \"description\": \"Agent Arena is an open-source, browser-native multi-agent playground. You place LLM-powered characters on a 3D map, watch them idle-talk, and chat with them privately or in a shared arena.\",\n            \"inLanguage\": \"en\",\n            \"publisher\": { \"@id\": \"https://github.com/sametkabay#person\" }\n          },\n          {\n            \"@type\": \"WebPage\",\n            \"@id\": \"https://sametkabay.github.io/agent-arena/#webpage\",\n            \"url\": \"https://sametkabay.github.io/agent-arena/\",\n            \"name\": \"Agent Arena \u2014 3D multi-agent playground in the browser\",\n            \"isPartOf\": { \"@id\": \"https://sametkabay.github.io/agent-arena/#website\" },\n            \"about\": { \"@id\": \"https://sametkabay.github.io/agent-arena/#app\" },\n            \"mainEntity\": { \"@id\": \"https://sametkabay.github.io/agent-arena/#app\" },\n            \"primaryImageOfPage\": \"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/sametkabay/agent-arena/main/docs/screenshot-space-night.png\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"@type\": [\"SoftwareApplication\", \"WebApplication\"],\n            \"@id\": \"https://sametkabay.github.io/agent-arena/#app\",\n            \"name\": \"Agent Arena\",\n            \"alternateName\": \"agent-arena\",\n            \"url\": \"https://sametkabay.github.io/agent-arena/\",\n            \"applicationCategory\": \"DeveloperApplication\",\n            \"operatingSystem\": \"Web browser\",\n            \"browserRequirements\": \"Requires WebGL2\",\n            \"softwareVersion\": \"0.1.0-preview\",\n            \"datePublished\": \"2026-08-06\",\n            \"offers\": {\n              \"@type\": \"Offer\",\n              \"price\": \"0\",\n              \"priceCurrency\": \"USD\"\n            },\n            \"description\": \"Agent Arena is an open-source, browser-native multi-agent playground. You place LLM-powered characters on a 3D map (office, forest, or space), watch them idle-talk, and chat with them privately or in a shared arena. It runs entirely in the browser with OpenAI, Gemini, Claude, or Ollama \u2014 no Agent Arena backend.\",\n            \"screenshot\": \"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/sametkabay/agent-arena/main/docs/screenshot-space-night.png\",\n            \"image\": \"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/sametkabay/agent-arena/main/docs/screenshot-space-night.png\",\n            \"author\": { \"@id\": \"https://github.com/sametkabay#person\" },\n            \"license\": \"https://github.com/sametkabay/agent-arena/blob/main/LICENSE\",\n            \"codeRepository\": \"https://github.com/sametkabay/agent-arena\",\n            \"sameAs\": [\n              \"https://github.com/sametkabay/agent-arena\",\n              \"https://sametkabay.github.io/agent-arena/\"\n            ]\n          },\n          {\n            \"@type\": \"SoftwareSourceCode\",\n            \"@id\": \"https://github.com/sametkabay/agent-arena#source\",\n            \"name\": \"Agent Arena\",\n            \"url\": \"https://github.com/sametkabay/agent-arena\",\n            \"codeRepository\": \"https://github.com/sametkabay/agent-arena\",\n            \"programmingLanguage\": [\"TypeScript\", \"JavaScript\"],\n            \"runtimePlatform\": \"Web browser\",\n            \"license\": \"https://spdx.org/licenses/MIT.html\",\n            \"isAccessibleForFree\": true,\n            \"author\": { \"@id\": \"https://github.com/sametkabay#person\" }\n          },\n          {\n            \"@type\": \"Person\",\n            \"@id\": \"https://github.com/sametkabay#person\",\n            \"name\": \"Samet Kabay\",\n            \"url\": \"https://github.com/sametkabay\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"@type\": \"FAQPage\",\n            \"@id\": \"https://sametkabay.github.io/agent-arena/#faq\",\n            \"mainEntity\": [\n              {\n                \"@type\": \"Question\",\n                \"name\": \"Do I need a backend to run Agent Arena?\",\n                \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n                  \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n                  \"text\": \"No. Agent Arena is a static client. You only need the LLM providers you choose (OpenAI, Gemini, Claude, Ollama, or a custom OpenAI-compatible gateway).\"\n                }\n              },\n              {\n                \"@type\": \"Question\",\n                \"name\": \"Are my API keys uploaded to Agent Arena?\",\n                \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n                  \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n                  \"text\": \"No. Keys stay in the browser (localStorage) and are sent only to the provider endpoints you configure. There is no Agent Arena backend holding secrets.\"\n                }\n              },\n              {\n                \"@type\": \"Question\",\n                \"name\": \"Can I run Agent Arena only on Ollama?\",\n                \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n                  \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n                  \"text\": \"Yes, locally with npm run dev. Ollama and localhost models do not work on the GitHub Pages demo because that host has no dev proxy.\"\n                }\n              },\n              {\n                \"@type\": \"Question\",\n                \"name\": \"What is Agent Arena not?\",\n                \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n                  \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n                  \"text\": \"Agent Arena is not a hosted multi-agent orchestration framework, not a Discord bot, and not a server-side agent runtime. It is a visual playground you run or host statically yourself.\"\n                }\n              }\n            ]\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    </script>\n    <script type=\"module\" crossorigin src=\"/agent-arena/assets/index-BPJuLZcf.js\"></script>\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" crossorigin href=\"/agent-arena/assets/index-BiFO7_oq.css\">\n  </head>\n  <body>\n    <div id=\"root\"></div>\n    <noscript>\n      <style>\n        .crawler-fallback {\n          font-family: Nunito, system-ui, sans-serif;\n          max-width: 42rem;\n          margin: 2rem auto;\n          padding: 0 1rem 3rem;\n          line-height: 1.55;\n          color: #1c1917;\n        }\n        .crawler-fallback h1 {\n          font-size: 1.75rem;\n        }\n        .crawler-fallback a {\n          color: #2563eb;\n        }\n      </style>\n      <article class=\"crawler-fallback\">\n        <h1>Agent Arena</h1>\n        <p>\n          Agent Arena is an open-source, browser-native multi-agent playground.\n          You place LLM-powered characters on a 3D map (office, forest, or\n          space), watch them idle-talk, and chat with them privately or in a\n          shared arena. It runs entirely in the browser with OpenAI, Gemini,\n          Claude, or Ollama \u2014 no Agent Arena backend.\n        </p>\n        <p>\n          This live page is a WebGL playground and needs JavaScript. Enable JS,\n          or open the\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/sametkabay/agent-arena\">source repo</a>.\n        </p>\n        <h2>What you can do</h2>\n        <ul>\n          <li>Drop personas onto Office, Nature, or Space maps</li>\n          <li>Private chat, arena broadcast, and @mention</li>\n          <li>Idle speech bubbles while the world runs</li>\n          <li>Full-screen map editor with .aamf.json import / export</li>\n          <li>YAML config for prompts, roles, characters, and defaults</li>\n        </ul>\n        <p>\n          What this is not: not a hosted multi-agent orchestration framework,\n          not a Discord bot, and not a server-side agent runtime.\n        </p>\n        <p>\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/sametkabay/agent-arena\">GitHub</a>\n          \u00b7\n          <a href=\"https://sametkabay.github.io/agent-arena/llms.txt\">llms.txt</a>\n          \u00b7 Code MIT; 3D assets CC0 / CC BY\n        </p>\n      </article>\n    </noscript>\n  </body>\n</html>\n", "erro": "", "ms": 625}